  "construction_method": "Execute composition_order exactly. All cells start from the frozen 848x1264 evidence snapshot and project the named historical witnesses through the declared masks. NAME cells derive a neutral quill mask from their type witness and fill it white before rarity projection, then apply the documented complete-quill recovery from its preserved raw output and mask.",
